  "claim_limit": "FUNCTIONAL_ONLY frozen-design source-sensitivity comparison. Both descriptive arms use the same frozen observed empirical z positions, ordered particle IDs, current pulse epoch, collapsed x/y positions, vy=0 and fixed 10 eV total kinetic energy. The paired comparison changes only the z-vz law from the current frozen affine authority to the observed nonlinear z-vz relation; positive vx is deterministically coupled within the same 10 eV shell. The comparison measures nonlinear z-vz residual sensitivity under the frozen three-zone design and does not claim that the nonlinearity cannot be compensated by a redesigned accelerator. No zero-vz arm is included. N=1 authorizes only its same-arm hash-bound N=100 successor after one complete finite detected path. N=100 may report Functional transport and source sensitivity only. The frozen real PA, geometry, field, particle selection, source authorities, cache policy and numerics are unchanged. No optimization, engineering qualification, Candidate promotion, COMSOL equivalence or Formal claim is authorized.",
